    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740340/extras/198b9347b8cabc297b56715028b6767f.avif?t=1752182825\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into NeuroMatrix, a gripping  first-person escape room adventure within the twisted, ever-evolving mind of an A.I.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It\u2019s just me, pouring my soul into this vision, crafting one level at a time. Want to back an indie dev\u2019s grind? Grab NeuroMatrix and take on the challenge. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you like the project and just want to help the development of the game, consider a simple donation with Paypal by using the &quot;<u>Visit the website</u>&quot; link on the right &gt;&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your support keeps this dream alive, thanks for stepping into my world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
